@startuml
' Deployment Diagram - BrewLite Assignment 2
' Phiên bản mô tả triển khai Render qua Git, không khẳng định Render lấy image từ GHCR.
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"

node "Thiết bị khách hàng" as client {
  artifact "Trình duyệt / Next.js UI" as browser
}

node "GitHub" as github {
  artifact "Repository\nCNPM_DoAn_Assignment2" as repo
  component "GitHub Actions CI/CD" as actions
}

cloud "GHCR (registry)" as ghcr {
  artifact "Image Web/API theo SHA hoặc tag" as images
}

cloud "Render - Production" as render {
  node "Web Service Frontend" as web {
    component "Next.js" as next
  }
  node "Web Service Backend" as api {
    component "NestJS / Prisma" as nest
  }
  database "PostgreSQL" as postgres
}

cloud "ZaloPay Sandbox" as zalopay

browser --> next : HTTPS 443
next --> nest : REST HTTPS 443
nest --> postgres : DATABASE_URL / PostgreSQL
nest --> zalopay : HTTPS tạo giao dịch/QueryDR
zalopay --> nest : HTTPS callback
repo --> actions : Push / Tag / PR
actions --> ghcr : Build / Push image
actions --> web : Render API / Git deploy
(Ví dụ CD 15-11-2026)
actions --> api : Render API / Git deploy
(Sau đó smoke /health, /products)

note bottom of actions
CI sử dụng PostgreSQL 16 test riêng.
Local chạy Compose: db + api + web.
Môi trường production lưu secrets tại Render/GitHub.
Rollback hiện là thủ công.
end note

@enduml
